        "What do you want to eat?",
        "What is your favorite color?",
        "What do you want to drink?",
        "Do you like coffee?"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Inumin means to drink."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which sentence means 'I do not like fish'?",
      "choices": [
        "Gusto ko ng isda.",
        "Ayaw ko ng isda.",
        "May isda ako.",
        "Busog ako."
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Ayaw ko ng expresses dislike."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which color phrase correctly uses a linker?",
      "choices": [
        "Pula na kotse",
        "Pulang kotse",
        "Pula ng kotse",
        "Pula ang kotse ko ng"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Pula becomes pulang before the noun."
